OL,3,GNEWSADelays and #20m cost rise for new
OL,4,ATurkish-built CalMac ferries
OL,5,
OL,6,FProject costs for the construction of
OL,7,Fnew CalMac ferries being built in
OL,8,FTurkey have risen by #20m as new delays
OL,9,Fare confirmed.
OL,11,FState-owned ferries agency CMAL said MV
OL,12,FLoch Indaal, the second of the four
OL,13,Fships being built by the Cemre
OL,14,Fshipyard, is now expected to be
OL,15,Fdelivered in October, about 20 months
OL,16,Flater than originally planned.
OL,18,FThe third and fourth ships, MV Lochmor
OL,19,Fand MV Claymore, earmarked to serve the
OL,20,FWestern Isles, are now both due to be
OL,21,Fdelivered in the first half of 2027.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
