OL,3,GNEWSADelays and #20m cost rise for new
OL,4,ATurkish-built CalMac ferries
OL,5,
OL,6,FCMAL announced in June that it had paid
OL,7,Fin full for the uncompleted ships to
OL,8,Fhelp the Turkish shipyard, which was
OL,9,Ffacing financial challenges.
